hadiths[277]{hadithnumber,text}:
"991","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Quran padho kyonke wo qayamat key din apne saathiyon key liye sifarshi bankar aayega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"992","Nawwas bin Samaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qayamat key din Quran aur uskey ghar walon ko laaya jaeyga jo duniya mein us par amal kartey they, uskey aagey Soorah Baqarah aur Aal-e-Imran hongi jo apne saathi ki taraf se jhagda kareingi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"993","Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein behtreen wo hai jo Quran seekhey aur sikhaey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"994","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quran padhta hai jabke wo us mein maahir hai to wo izzat waley naik likhney walon key sath hai, aur jo Quran padhta hai aur us mein atak-ta hai jabke wo us par mushkil hai to uskey liye do ajr hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"995","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us momin ki misaal jo Quran padhta hai turanj ki si hai: Uski khushbu achchhi hai aur uska zaaiqa achchha hai. Aur us momin ki misaal jo Quran nahi padhta khajoor ki si hai: Uski khushbu nahi hai aur uska zaaiqa meetha hai. Aur us munaafiq ki misaal jo Quran padhta hai rehaan ki si hai: Uski khushbu achchhi hai aur uska zaaiqa kadwa hai. Aur us munaafiq ki misaal jo Quran nahi padhta indraayan ki si hai: Uski khushbu nahi hai aur uska zaaiqa kadwa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"996","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah is kitaab key sabab qaumon ko buland farmata hai aur us se doosron ko past karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"997","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rashk sirf do mein hai: Aik aadmi jisey Allah ne Quran diya aur wo raat aur din key auqaat mein uskey sath qayaam karta hai, aur aik aadmi jisey Allah ne maal diya aur wo raat aur din key auqaat mein usey kharch karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"998","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Soorah Kahf padh raha tha jabke uskey paas ghoda do rasiyon key sath bandha hua tha. To usey baadal ne dhaanp liya aur wo qareeb honay laga, aur uska ghoda us se badak-ney laga. Phir jab subah hui to wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap se uska zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo sukoon tha jo Quran key liye utra tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"999","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ki kitaab mein se aik harf padhey to uskey liye neki hai, aur neki das guna hai. Main nahi kehta: Alif laam meem harf hai, lekin alif harf hai, aur laam harf hai, aur meem harf hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1000","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak wo jiskey pait mein Quran mein se kuchh nahi hai wo weeran ghar ki tarah hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1001","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhum) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran waley se kaha jaeyga: Padh aur chadh aur theher theher kar padh jaisa tu duniya mein theher theher kar padhta tha. Kyonke tumhara thikana us aakhri aayat key paas hai jo tum padhtey ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1002","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Is Quran ki nigehbaani karo, kyonke us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Wo rasiyon mein bandhey huey oonton se zyada nikal bhaagney wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1003","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran waley ki misaal rasiyon se bandhey huey oonton ki si hai: Agar wo unki nigehbaani karey to unhey rok leyga, aur agar unhey chhor dey to wo chali jaengi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1004","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah ne kisi chiz ko aisa nahi suna jaisa us Nabi ko jiski awaz achchhi ho jo Quran ko gaa kar buland awaz se padhta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1005","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Tumhey Aale Dawood key baajon mein se aik baaja diya gaya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Kaash tum mujhey dekhtey jab main kal raat tumhari qiraat sun raha tha."
"1006","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Isha mein Watteen Waz Zaitoon padhtey huey suna. To main ne Aap se zyada khubsurat awaz wala koi nahi suna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1007","Abu Lubaaba Basheer bin Abdul Munzir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Quran ko gaa kar na padhey wo ham mein se nahi. Ise Abu Dawud ne jayyad sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1008","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Mujh par Quran padho. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main tum par padhun jabke wo tum par naazil hua hai?! Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main pasand karta hun ke usey ghair se sunun. To main ne Aap par Soorah Nisa padhi yahan tak ke is aayat tak aaya: Phir kya haal hoga jab ham har ummat mein se gawaah laaengey aur tumhey in par gawaah laaengey. Aap ne farmaya: Ab bas karo. To main Aap ki taraf mutawajjah hua aur Aap ki donon aankhein beh rahi thein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1009","Abu Saeed Raafe bin Al-Mualla (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya main tumhey masjid se nikalney se pehley Quran mein sab se azeem soorat na sikhaun? To Aap ne mera haath pakda. Phir jab ham nikalna chaahtey they to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tum ne kaha tha ke main tumhey Quran mein sab se azeem soorat sikhaaunga? Aap ne farmaya: Alhamdolillahi Rabbil Aalameen, wahi Saat dohrai jaaney waliyan hain, aur Quran-e-Azeem hai jo mujhey diya gaya hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1010","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Qul huwallahu ahad key baarey mein farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo Quran key tihaai key barabar hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba se farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke raat mein Quran ka tihaai padhey? To wo un par mushkil hua aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham mein se kaun uski taqat rakhta hai ya Rasulullah? To farmaya: Qul huwallahu ahad Quran ka tihaai hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1011","Unhin se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne aik aadmi ko Qul huwallahu ahad padhtey huey suna aur usey dohra raha tha. Phir jab subah hui to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap se uska zikr kya, jabke wo aadmi usey kam samajhta tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak wo Quran key tihaai key barabar hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1012","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Qul huwallahu ahad key baarey mein farmaya: Beshak wo Quran key tihaai key barabar hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1013","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main is soorat Qul huwallahu ahad se mohabbat karta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak uski mohabbat tumhey Jannat mein dakhil karegi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Ise Bukhari ne apni Sahih mein taaleeqan riwayat kya hai."
"1014","Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne nahi dekha aayaat jo aaj raat naazil hui hain jaisi kabhi nahi dekhi gaein? Qul a'oozu birabbil falaq, aur Qul a'oozu birabbin naas. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1015","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jinnaat se aur insaan ki nazar se panah maangtey they, yahan tak ke Muawwizatain naazil huein. Phir jab wo naazil huein to unhey liya aur uskey siwa ko chhor diya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1016","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran mein tees aayaton wali soorat hai jis ne aadmi key liye sifarish ki yahan tak ke usey bakhsh diya gaya, aur wo hai: Tabaarakallazi biyadihil mulk. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur Abu Dawud ki riwayat mein hai: Sifarish karegi."
"1017","Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Soorah Baqarah ki aakhri do aayaat raat mein padhey to wo usey kaafi hongi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1018","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne gharon ko qabreim na banao. Beshak shaitaan us ghar se bhaagta hai jis mein Soorah Baqarah padhi jaati hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1019","Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abul Munzir! Kya tum jaantey ho Allah ki kitaab mein se tumharey paas kaun si aayat azeem hai? Main ne kaha: Allah, uskey siwa koi mabood nahi, jo zinda qayam rehne wala hai. To Aap ne merey seeney mein haath maara aur farmaya: Ae Abul Munzir! Tumhey ilm mubaarak ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1020","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Ramazan ki zakaat ki hifaazat par muqarrar kya. To merey paas aaney wala aaya aur khaaney mein se lap bharney laga. To main ne usey pakad liya aur kaha: Main tumhey zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ley jaaunga. Us ne kaha: Beshak main mohtaaj hun, aur mujh par ghar waley hain, aur mujhey sakht haajat hai. To main ne usey chhor diya. Phir subah hui aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Tumharey kal raat waley qaidi ne kya kya? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne haajat aur ghar walon ki shikayat ki, to main ne us par rehem kya aur usey chhor diya. To farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak us ne tum se jhoot kaha hai aur wo wapas aayega. To main ne pehchaan liya ke wo wapas aayega Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key qaul ki wjah se. To main uskey liye ghaat mein raha. To wo aaya aur khaaney mein se lap bharney laga. To main ne kaha: Main tumhey zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ley jaaunga. Us ne kaha: Mujhey chhor do kyonke main mohtaaj hun aur mujh par ghar waley hain, main wapas nahi aaunga. To main ne us par rehem kya aur usey chhor diya. Phir subah hui aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Tumharey kal raat waley qaidi ne kya kya? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne haajat aur ghar walon ki shikayat ki, to main ne us par rehem kya aur usey chhor diya. To farmaya: Beshak us ne tum se jhoot kaha hai aur wo wapas aayega. To main teesri martaba uskey liye ghaat mein raha. To wo aaya aur khaaney mein se lap bharney laga. To main ne usey pakad liya aur kaha: Main tumhey zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas ley jaaunga, aur ye teen mein se aakhri hai ke tum gumaan kartey ho ke tum wapas nahi aaogey, phir wapas aatey ho! To us ne kaha: Mujhey chhor do kyonke main tumhey aise kalimey sikhaata hun jin se Allah tumhey faeda dega. Main ne kaha: Wo kya hain? Us ne kaha: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to Aayatul Kursi padho, kyonke tum par Allah ki taraf se hamesha nigehbaan raheyga, aur subah tak tumharey qareeb shaitaan nahi aayega. To main ne usey chhor diya. Phir subah hui aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tumharey kal raat waley qaidi ne kya kya? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne gumaan kya ke wo mujhey aise kalimey sikhaata hai jin se Allah mujhey faeda dega, to main ne usey chhor diya. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hain? Main ne kaha: Us ne mujh se kaha: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to Aayatul Kursi awwal se padho yahan tak ke aayat khatm karo: Allah, uskey siwa koi mabood nahi, jo zinda qayam rehne wala hai. Aur us ne mujh se kaha: Tum par Allah ki taraf se hamesha nigehbaan raheyga, aur subah tak tumharey qareeb shaitaan nahi aayega. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak us ne tum se sach kaha hai jabke wo jhoota hai. Kya tum jaantey ho tum teen se kissey baat kar rahey they ae Abu Hurairah? Main ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Wo shaitaan tha."
"1021","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Soorah Kahf ki ibtidai das aayaat yaad karey wo Dajjaal se bachaaya jaeyga. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Soorah Kahf ki aakhri se. In donon ko Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1022","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas baithey huey they ke unhon-ne apne oopar se awaz suni. To unhon-ne apna sar uthaya aur farmaya: Ye aasmaan ka darwaza hai jo aaj khola gaya hai aur aaj key siwa kabhi nahi khola gaya. To us mein se farishta utra aur farmaya: Ye farishta zameen ki taraf utra hai jo aaj key siwa kabhi nahi utra. To us ne salaam kya aur kaha: Do nooron ki bashaarat lo jo tumhey diye gaey hain, jo tum se pehley kisi Nabi ko nahi diye gaey: Faatihatul Kitaab, aur Soorah Baqarah key aakhri hissey. Tum un mein se koi harf nahi padhogey magar tumhey diya jaeyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Naqeez awaz hai."
"1023","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum Allah key gharon mein se kisi ghar mein jama ho aur Allah ki kitaab padhey aur aapas mein uska daur karey to un par sukoon naazil hota hai, aur rehmat unhey dhaanp leti hai, aur farishtey unhey gher letey hain, aur Allah unhey unkey paas walon mein yaad farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1024","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak meri ummat qayamat key din bulaai jaeygi jabke wuzu key asraat se peshaani aur haath paaon chamaktey hongey. Phir tum mein se jo apni chamak lambi kar sakey to karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1025","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Momin ka zewar wahaan tak pahunchta hai jahaan tak wuzu pahunchta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1026","Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo wuzu karey aur achchha wuzu karey to uskey gunaah uskey jism se nikal jaatey hain yahan tak ke uskey naakhunon key neechey se nikal jaatey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1027","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko merey is wuzu jaisa wuzu kartey huey dekha, phir farmaya: Jo is tarah wuzu karey to uskey guzashta gunaah bakhsh diye jaatey hain, aur uski namaz aur masjid ki taraf uska chalna nafl hoga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1028","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Musalman, ya momin banda wuzu karta hai aur apna chehra dhoota hai to uskey chehrey se har khata nikal jaati hai jisey us ne apni aankhon se dekha tha paani key sath, ya paani key aakhri qatrey key sath. Phir jab apne donon haath dhoota hai to uskey donon haathon se har khata nikal jaati hai jo uskey donon haathon ne pakdi thi paani key sath, ya paani key aakhri qatrey key sath. Phir jab apne donon paaon dhoota hai to har khata nikal jaati hai jis par uskey donon paaon chaley they paani key sath, ya paani key aakhri qatrey key sath. Yahan tak ke wo gunaahon se paak nikalta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1029","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabrastaan tashreef laey aur farmaya: Assalamu alaikum, ae momin qaum key ghar! Aur beshak ham Insha Allah tum se milney waley hain. Kaash ham ne apne bhaiyon ko dekha hota! Unhon-ne kaha: Kya ham tumharey bhai nahi hain ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Tum merey sahaaba ho, aur hamarey bhai wo hain jo abhi nahi aey. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum apni ummat mein se usey kaisey pehchaanogey jo abhi nahi aaya ya Rasulullah? To farmaya: Batao agar kisi aadmi key chamaktey peshaani aur haath paaon waley ghodey hon kaaley ghodey key darmiyaan, kya wo apne ghodey nahi pehchaaneyga? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: To wo wuzu key sabab chamaktey peshaani aur haath paaon key sath aaengey, aur main Hauz par unka aagey hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1030","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey uski taraf rahnumai na karun jis se Allah khataein mitaata hai aur darjaat buland farmata hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Naapasand par poora wuzu karna, aur masaajid ki taraf kasrat se qadam, aur namaz key baad namaz ka intizaar karna. To wahi sarhad ki hifaazat hai, to wahi sarhad ki hifaazat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1031","Abu Maalik Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paaki imaan ka aadha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur ye apni taveel soorat mein Sabr key baab mein guzar chuki hai. Aur is baab mein Amr bin Abasa (Raziallahu anhu) ki peechli hadis hai Ummeed key baab key aakhir mein, aur wo azeem hadis hai jo bhalaiyon key jumlon par mushtamil hai."
"1032","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo wuzu karey aur wuzu ko pahunchaye, ya poora karey, phir kahey: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain, to uskey liye Jannat key aathon darwaazey khol diye jaatey hain, jis se chaahey dakhil ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Tirmizi ne izafa kya hai: Ae Allah! Mujhey tauba karne walon mein se bana aur mujhey paak rehne walon mein se bana."
"1033","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar log jaantey ke azaan aur pehli saf mein kya hai phir us par qura andaazi key siwa na paatey to us par qura andaazi kartey. Aur agar wo jaantey ke jaldi aaney mein kya hai to uski taraf sabqat kartey. Aur agar wo jaantey ke Isha aur Subah mein kya hai to unkey paas aatey chaahey ghisat kar. (Muttafaqun aleh). Walistihaam qura andaazi hai. Wattahjeer namaz key liye jaldi aana hai."
"1034","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Moazzin qayamat key din logon mein sab se lambi gardanon waley hongey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1035","Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Saasa'a se riwayat hai ke Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Beshak main tumhey bakriyan aur jungle pasand kartey huey dekhta hun. Phir jab tum apni bakriyon mein, ya jungle mein ho aur namaz key liye azaan do to azaan key sath apni awaz buland karo. Kyonke moazzin ki awaz ki inteha ko jinn aur ins aur koi chiz nahi sunti magar qayamat key din uskey liye gawahi degi. Abu Saeed ne kaha: Main ne usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1036","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz key liye azaan di jaati hai to shaitaan peeth pher kar bhaagta hai jabke usey hawa khaarij hoti hai yahan tak ke azaan na suney. Phir jab azaan poori ho jaati hai to aata hai. Yahan tak ke jab namaz key liye iqaamat kahi jaati hai to peeth pher kar bhaagta hai. Yahan tak ke jab iqaamat poori ho jaati hai to aata hai yahan tak ke aadmi aur uskey nafs key darmiyaan khatra daalta hai aur kehta hai: Fulaan yaad karo, aur fulaan yaad karo, jo us ne pehley yaad nahi kya tha. Yahan tak ke aadmi rehta hai aur nahi jaanta ke us ne kitni padhi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1037","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum azaan suno to waisa kaho jaisa wo kehta hai, phir mujh par durood bhejo. Kyonke jo mujh par durood bhejta hai to Allah us par uskey sabab das martaba rehmat bhejta hai. Phir Allah se merey liye Waseela maango. Kyonke wo Jannat mein manzil hai jo Allah key bandon mein se aik bandey key siwa kisi ko laaiq nahi, aur mujhey ummeed hai ke main wahi hun. Phir jo merey liye Waseela maangey to uskey liye shafaa'at halaal ho gai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1038","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum azaan suno to waisa kaho jaisa moazzin kehta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1039","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo azaan suntey waqt kahey: Ae Allah! Is kaamil dawat key Rab, aur qaim namaz key! Muhammad ko Waseela aur fazilat ata farma, aur unhey Maqaam-e-Mehmood par bhej jis ka Tune un se waada kya hai, to uskey liye qayamat key din meri shafaa'at halaal ho gai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1040","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo moazzin ko suntey waqt kahey: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, aur Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. Main Allah key Rab honay par aur Islam key deen honay par raazi hun, to uska gunaah bakhsh diya jaeyga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1041","Anas se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Dua azaan aur iqaamat key darmiyaan radd nahi ki jaati. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1042","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Batao agar tum mein se kisi key darwaazey par neher ho jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusl karta ho, kya uskey mail mein se kuchh baqi raheyga? Unhon-ne kaha: Uskey mail mein se kuchh baqi nahi raheyga. Aap ne farmaya: To paanch namazon ki misaal aisi hai, Allah un se khataein mitaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1043","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch namazon ki misaal gehri behti hui neher ki si hai jo tum mein se kisi key darwaazey par ho jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusl karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1044","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne aik aurat se bosa liya. To wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Allah Taala ne naazil kya: Namaz qaim karo din key donon kinaaron mein aur raat key hissey mein. Beshak nekiyan buraiyon ko door karti hain. To us aadmi ne kaha: Ye merey liye hai? Aap ne farmaya: Meri tamaam ummat key liye hai sab key sab. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1045","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch namazein, aur Juma sey Juma tak, darmiyaan ka kaffara hain jab tak kabeera gunaahon se bacha jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1046","Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Musalman aadmi ho jis par farz namaz haazir ho aur wo uska wuzu aur khushu aur ruku achchha karey to wo us se pehley gunaahon ka kaffara hogi jab tak kabeera gunaah na kya jaey, aur ye hamesha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1047","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo thandi donon namazein padhey wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1048","Abu Zuhair Umaara bin Ruwaiba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Dozakh mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jis ne suraj key tuloo se pehley aur uskey ghuroob se pehley namaz padhi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1049","Jundab bin Sufyan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Subah padhey wo Allah key zimma mein hai. Phir dekh ae aadmi key betey! Allah tum se apne zimma mein se kisi chiz ka mutaaliba na karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1050","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein baari baari farishtey aatey hain raat mein, aur din mein farishtey. Aur wo Subah ki namaz aur Asr ki namaz mein jama hotey hain. Phir wo jo tum mein raat guzaartey hain chadhtey hain. To Allah un se poochhta hai, jabke wo unhey zyada jaanne wala hai: Tum ne merey bandon ko kaisey chhora? To wo kehtey hain: Ham ne unhey chhora jabke wo namaz padh rahey they, aur ham unkey paas aey jabke wo namaz padh rahey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1051","Jareer bin Abdullah Bajali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they. To Aap ne chaundhween raat key chaand ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Beshak tum apne Rab ko dekhogey jaisa is chaand ko dekhtey ho, uskey dekhney mein tum par zulm nahi kya jaeyga. Phir agar tum taqat rakho ke suraj key tuloo se pehley ki namaz par aur uskey ghuroob se pehley par ghaalib na aao to karo. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Aap ne chaundhween raat key chaand ki taraf dekha."
"1052","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Asr ki namaz chhor dey to uska amal zaaya ho gaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1053","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo subah ya shaam masjid ki taraf jaey to Allah uskey liye Jannat mein mehmani taiyaar farmata hai jab kabhi subah ya shaam jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1054","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghar mein paaki haasil karey, phir Allah key gharon mein se kisi ghar ki taraf jaey taake Allah key faraaiz mein se farz ada karey, to uskey qadam, aik khata mitaata hai aur doosra darja buland karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1055","Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ansaar mein se aik aadmi tha jis se zyada door masjid se kisi ko nahi jaanta tha, aur us se koi namaz nahi chhoot-ti thi! To us se kaha gaya: Kaash tum gadha khareed lo jis par andherey mein aur garmi mein sawaar ho. Us ne kaha: Mujhey pasand nahi ke mera ghar masjid key pehlu mein ho, beshak main chaahta hun ke merey liye masjid ki taraf mera chalna likha jaey, aur mera wapas aana jab main apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aaun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumharey liye wo sab jama kar diya hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1056","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Masjid key ird gird jaghein khaali huein aur Bani Salama ne chaaha ke masjid key qareeb muntaqil ho jaein. To ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi aur Aap ne un se farmaya: Mujhey pahunchi hai ke tum masjid key qareeb muntaqil hona chaahtey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan ya Rasulullah, beshak ham ne ye chaaha hai. To farmaya: Ae Bani Salama! Tumharey ghar tumharey nishaan likhtey hain, tumharey ghar tumharey nishaan likhtey hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Hamein pasand nahi ke ham muntaqil huey hotey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur Bukhari ne Anas ki riwayat se maana riwayat kya hai."
"1057","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak namaz mein ajr key lihaaz se sab se azeem aadmi wo hai jo uski taraf sab se door chalney wala hai, phir sab se door. Aur jo namaz ka intizaar karta hai yahan tak ke usey imam key sath padhta hai wo us se azeem ajr wala hai jo usey padhta hai phir sota hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1058","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Andheron mein masaajid ki taraf chalne walon ko qayamat key din kaamil noor ki bashaarat do. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"1059","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey uski taraf rahnumai na karun jis se Allah khataein mitaata hai aur darjaat buland farmata hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Naapasand par poora wuzu karna, aur masaajid ki taraf kasrat se qadam, aur namaz key baad namaz ka intizaar karna. To wahi sarhad ki hifaazat hai, to wahi sarhad ki hifaazat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1060","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum us aadmi ko dekho jo masaajid ka aadi hai to uskey liye imaan ki gawahi do. Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Allah ki masaajid ko sirf wahi aabaad karta hai jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai, aayat. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1061","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi namaz mein rehta hai jab tak namaz usey rok kar rakhey, usey apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aaney se sirf namaz rokti hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1062","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishtey tum mein se har aik par rehmat bhejtey hain jab tak wo apni jaey namaz mein hai jis mein us ne namaz padhi hai, jab tak wo behayaai na karey. Kehtey hain: Ae Allah! Usey bakhsh dey, ae Allah! Us par rehem farma. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1063","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raat mein Isha ki namaz dair se aadhi raat tak padhai, phir namaz key baad apne chehrey key sath hamari taraf mutawajjah huey aur farmaya: Logon ne namaz padhi aur soey, aur tum namaz mein rahey jab se tum ne uska intizaar kya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1064","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jamaat ki namaz akeley ki namaz se sattais darjaat afzal hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1065","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ki jamaat mein namaz uski ghar aur bazaar mein namaz par pachees guna badhai jaati hai. Aur wo isliye ke jab wo wuzu karta hai aur achchha wuzu karta hai, phir masjid ki taraf nikalta hai, usey sirf namaz nikaalti hai. Wo koi qadam nahi uthata magar uskey sabab uskey liye darja buland kya jaata hai, aur us se khata mitaai jaati hai. Phir jab namaz padhta hai to farishtey us par rehmat bhejtey rehtey hain jab tak wo apni jaey namaz mein hai, jab tak wo behayaai na karey. Kehtey hain: Ae Allah! Us par rehmat bhej, ae Allah! Us par rehem farma. Aur wo namaz mein rehta hai jab tak namaz ka intizaar karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh. Aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai)."
"1066","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas andha aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Merey paas koi ley jaaney wala nahi hai jo mujhey masjid tak ley jaey. To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha ke usey rukhsat dein aur wo apne ghar mein namaz padhey. To Aap ne usey rukhsat di. Phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to usey bulaya aur us se farmaya: Kya tum namaz ki azaan suntey ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: To jawab do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1067","Abdullah, aur kaha gaya Amr bin Qais jo Ibn Umm Maktoom Moazzin key naam se mashhoor hain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Madina mein zehreelay jaanwar aur darindey bahut hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Hayya Alas Salaah, Hayya Alal Falaah suntey ho, to aao. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1068","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ne irada kya hai ke lakdi ka hukm dun aur wo jama ki jaey, phir namaz ka hukm dun aur uskey liye azaan di jaey, phir aadmi ko hukm dun aur wo logon ki imaamat karaye, phir aadmiyon ki taraf mukhaalifat karun aur un par unkey ghar jala dun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1069","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jo chahta hai ke kal Allah Taala se Musalman hokar miley to in namazon ki muhaafazat karey jahaan unkey liye pukaara jaata hai. Kyonke Allah ne tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye hidayat ki sunnatein muqarrar ki hain, aur wo hidayat ki sunnaton mein se hain. Aur agar tum apne gharon mein namaz padhogey jaisa ye peechey rehne wala apne ghar mein padhta hai to tum apne Nabi ki sunnat chhor dogey. Aur agar tum apne Nabi ki sunnat chhor dogey to gumraah ho jaogey. Aur beshak ham ne apne aap ko dekha hai ke us se sirf wahi peechey rehta hai jo maloom nifaaq wala munaafiq hai. Aur beshak aadmi laaya jaata tha jabke wo do aadmiyon key darmiyaan jhulaaya jaata tha yahan tak ke saf mein khada kya jaata tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein farmaya: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hidayat ki sunnatein sikhaein, aur beshak hidayat mein se us masjid mein namaz hai jis mein azaan di jaati hai."
"1070","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Koi teen basti ya jungle mein nahi hain jin mein namaz qaim nahi ki jaati magar shaitaan un par ghaalib aa gaya hai. Isliye tum par jamaat laazim hai, kyonke bhediya bakriyon mein se alag honay wali ko khaata hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1071","Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Isha jamaat mein padhey to goya us ne aadhi raat qayaam kya. Aur jo Subah jamaat mein padhey to goya us ne poori raat namaz padhi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Tirmizi ki riwayat mein hai Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Isha jamaat mein haazir ho uskey liye aadhi raat ka qayaam hoga, aur jo Isha aur Fajr jamaat mein haazir ho uskey liye poori raat key qayaam jaisa hoga. Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1072","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur agar wo jaantey ke Isha aur Subah mein kya hai to unkey paas aatey chaahey ghisat kar. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye apni taveel soorat mein guzar chuki hai."
"1073","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munaafiqon par Fajr aur Isha ki namaz se bhaari koi namaz nahi hai. Aur agar wo jaantey ke un donon mein kya hai to unkey paas aatey chaahey ghisat kar. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1074","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Namaz apne waqt par. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Walidain key sath husn-e-sulook. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun sa? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key rastey mein jihad. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1075","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam ki bunyaad paanch par rakhi gai hai: Gawahi ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur namaz qaim karna, aur zakaat dena, aur Baitullah ka Hajj karna, aur Ramazan key rozey rakhna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1076","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur namaz qaim karein aur zakaat dein. Phir agar wo ye karein to unhon-ne mujh se apne khoon aur maal bacha liye siwaey Islam key haq key, aur unka hisaab Allah par hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1077","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Yaman ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Beshak tum Ahle Kitaab ki qaum key paas jaatey ho. To unhey dawat do ke gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah Taala ne un par har din raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah Taala ne un par sadqa farz kya hai jo unkey maaldaaron se liya jaata hai aur unkey faqiron ko wapas kya jaata hai. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unkey umda maalon se bacho aur mazloom ki baddua se daro kyonke uskey aur Allah key darmiyaan parda nahi hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1078","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak aadmi aur shirk aur kufr key darmiyaan namaz chhorna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1079","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo ahd jo hamarey aur unkey darmiyaan hai namaz hai. Phir jo usey chhor dey to us ne kufr kya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1080","Shaqeeq bin Abdullah Taabai jinki jalaalat par ijmaa hai (Rehmatullah aleh) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba namaz key siwa aamaal mein se kisi key chhorney ko kufr nahi samajhtey they. Ise Tirmizi ne Kitaabul Imaan mein sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1081","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se pehley jiska bandey se qayamat key din uskey amal mein se hisaab liya jaeyga uski namaz hai. Phir agar wo durust hui to wo kamyaab hua aur nijaat paai. Aur agar wo bigad gai to wo naakaam hua aur khasaarey mein raha. Phir agar uskey farz mein se kuchh kami hui to Rab Azza wa Jall farmayega: Dekho kya merey bandey key paas nafl mein se kuchh hai? To us mein se poora kya jaeyga jo farz mein se kami hui? Phir uskey baqi aamaal is par hongey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1082","Jabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas nikley aur farmaya: Kya tum safein nahi baandhtey jaisa farishtey apne Rab key paas safein baandhtey hain? To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur farishtey apne Rab key paas kaisey safein baandhtey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo pehli safein poori kartey hain aur saf mein mil kar khadey hotey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1083","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar log jaantey ke azaan aur pehli saf mein kya hai, phir us par qura andaazi key siwa na paatey to us par qura andaazi kartey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1084","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon ki behtreen safein pehli hain, aur unki badtareen aakhri hain. Aur aurton ki behtreen safein aakhri hain, aur unki badtareen pehli hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1085","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba mein peechey rehna dekha. To un se farmaya: Aagey badho aur meri iqtida karo, aur tumharey baad waley tumhari iqtida karein. Qaum hamesha peechey rehti hai yahan tak ke Allah unhey peechey kar deta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1086","Abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz mein hamarey kandhey chhoote they aur farmatey they: Seedhey hojao aur ikhtilaaf na karo warna tumharey dil ikhtilaaf kareingey. Mujh se tum mein aqal aur samajh waley milein, phir jo unkey peechey hon, phir jo unkey peechey hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1087","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni safein seedhi karo, kyonke saf ko seedha karna namaz key poora honay se hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Bukhari ki riwayat mein hai: Kyonke safon ko seedha karna namaz qaim karney se hai."
"1088","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Namaz khadi ki gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne chehrey key sath hamari taraf mutawajjah huey aur farmaya: Apni safein seedhi karo aur mil kar khadey ho, kyonke main tumhey apni peeth key peechey se dekhta hun. Ise Bukhari ne apne lafz key sath riwayat kya hai, aur Muslim ne maana key sath. Aur Bukhari ki aik riwayat mein hai: Aur ham mein se har aik apna kandha apne saathi key kandhey se aur apna qadam uskey qadam se milata tha."
"1089","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum apni safein zaroor seedhi karogey, warna Allah tumharey chehron key darmiyaan mukhaalifat daal dega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari safein seedhi kartey they yahan tak ke goya un se teer seedhey kartey hain, yahan tak ke dekha ke ham ne Aap se samajh liya hai. Phir aik din nikley aur khadey huey yahan tak ke takbeer kehney key qareeb they. To Aap ne aik aadmi ko dekha jiska seena saf se baahar tha. To farmaya: Ae Allah key bando! Tum apni safein zaroor seedhi karogey, warna Allah tumharey chehron key darmiyaan mukhaalifat daal dega."
"1090","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik taraf se doosri taraf daakhil hotey they, hamarey seeney aur kandhey chhoote they aur farmatey they: Ikhtilaaf na karo warna tumharey dil ikhtilaaf kareingey. Aur farmatey they: Beshak Allah aur uskey farishtey pehli safon par rehmat bhejtey hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1091","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safein seedhi karo, aur kandhey barabar karo, aur khala band karo, aur apne bhaiyon key haathon mein narm hojao, aur shaitaan key liye jaghein na chhoro. Aur jo saf milayega Allah usey milaayega, aur jo saf kaateyga Allah usey kaateyga. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1092","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni safein milayo, aur unkey darmiyaan qareeb karo, aur gardaneim barabar karo. To us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main shaitaan ko dekhta hun ke wo saf key khala mein dakhil hota hai goya bakri ka bachcha hai. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne Muslim ki shart par sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1093","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehli saf poori karo, phir jo uskey peechey hai. Phir jo kami ho wo pichhli saf mein ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1094","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah aur uskey farishtey safon key daayein taraf walon par rehmat bhejtey hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne Muslim ki shart par sanad se riwayat kya hai, aur us mein aik aadmi hai jiski tauseeq mein ikhtilaaf hai."
"1095","Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey namaz padhtey they to pasand kartey they ke Aap key daayein hon. Aap hamari taraf apne chehrey key sath mutawajjah hotey they. To main ne Aap ko farmatey huey suna: Ae Rab! Mujhey apne azaab se bacha jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthayega, ya jama karega. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1096","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam ko darmiyaan mein karo, aur khala band karo. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1097","Ummul Momineen Umm Habeeba Ramla bint Abi Sufyan (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Musalman banda Allah Taala key liye har din farz key siwa baarah rakaatein nafl padhey to Allah uskey liye Jannat mein ghar banaata hai, ya: Uskey liye Jannat mein ghar banaya jaata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1098","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Zuhr se pehley do rakaatein padhein aur uskey baad do rakaatein, aur Juma key baad do rakaatein, aur Maghrib key baad do rakaatein, aur Isha key baad do rakaatein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1099","Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har do azaanon key darmiyaan namaz hai, har do azaanon key darmiyaan namaz hai, har do azaanon key darmiyaan namaz hai. Aur teesri mein farmaya: Jo chaahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1100","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zuhr se pehley chaar aur Subah se pehley do nahi chhorte they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1101","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nafl mein se kisi ki Fajr ki do rakaaton se zyada pabandi nahi farmatey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1102","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fajr ki do rakaatein duniya aur jo kuchh us mein hai us se behtar hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai: Mujhey tamaam duniya se zyada mehboob hain."
"1103","Abu Abdullah Bilaal bin Rabaah (Raziallahu anhu) jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key moazzin hain, se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey taake Aap ko Subah ki namaz ki ittila dein. To Aaisha ne Bilaal ko us kaam mein mashghool kya jiskey baarey mein unhon-ne un se poochha tha, yahan tak ke khoob subah ho gai. To Bilaal khada hua aur Aap ko namaz ki ittila di aur apni azaan jaari rakhi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na nikley. Phir jab Aap nikley to logon ko namaz padhai. To unhon-ne Aap ko khabar di ke Aaisha ne unhey us kaam mein mashghool kya jiskey baarey mein unhon-ne un se poochha tha yahan tak ke khoob subah ho gai, aur Aap key nikalney mein un par dair hui. To farmaya, yaani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne: Beshak main ne Fajr ki do rakaatein padhi thein. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tumhey khoob subah ho gai hai? To farmaya: Agar mujhey is se zyada subah ho jaati to main unhey padhta aur achchha aur khubsurat karta. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1104","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Subah ki namaz ki azaan aur iqaamat key darmiyaan do halki rakaatein padhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jab azaan suntey to Fajr ki do rakaatein padhtey aur unhey halka kartey yahan tak ke main kahun: Kya un donon mein Ummul Quran bhi padhi hai! Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jab azaan suntey to Fajr ki do rakaatein padhtey aur halka kartey they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jab Fajr tuloo hoti."
"1105","Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab moazzin Subah key liye azaan deta aur Subah zaahir hoti to do halki rakaatein padhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Fajr tuloo hoti to do halki rakaaton key siwa nahi padhtey they."
"1106","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein do do padhtey they, aur raat key aakhir mein aik key sath witr kartey they. Aur Subah ki namaz se pehley do rakaatein padhtey they, goya azaan unkey donon kaanon mein thi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1107","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fajr ki do rakaaton mein pehli mein padhtey they: Kaho ham Allah par imaan laey aur jo hamari taraf naazil hua, wo aayat jo Baqarah mein hai. Aur doosri mein: Ham Allah par imaan laey aur gawahi do ke ham Musalman hain. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Doosri mein jo Aal-e-Imran mein hai: Aao us kalimey ki taraf jo hamarey aur tumharey darmiyaan barabar hai. In donon ko Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1108","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fajr ki do rakaaton mein padha: Qul ya ayyuhal kaafiroon, aur Qul huwallahu ahad. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1109","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik maah dekha ke Fajr se pehley do rakaaton mein padhtey they: Qul ya ayyuhal kaafiroon, aur Qul huwallahu ahad. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1110","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Fajr ki do rakaatein padhtey to daayein pehlu par late jaatey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1111","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Isha ki namaz se faarigh honay aur Fajr key darmiyaan gyaarah rakaatein padhtey they, har do rakaaton key darmiyaan salaam phertey they, aur aik key sath witr kartey they. Phir jab moazzin Fajr ki namaz se khamosh hota, aur uskey liye Fajr zaahir hoti, aur moazzin aata to khadey hotey aur do halki rakaatein padhtey, phir daayein pehlu par is tarah late jaatey yahan tak ke moazzin iqaamat key liye aata. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1112","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Fajr ki do rakaatein padhey to daayein taraf late jaey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1113","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Zuhr se pehley do rakaatein padhein, aur uskey baad do rakaatein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1114","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zuhr se pehley chaar nahi chhorte they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1115","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey ghar mein Zuhr se pehley chaar padhtey they, phir nikaltey aur logon ko namaz padhaatey they. Phir dakhil hotey aur do rakaatein padhtey they. Aur logon ko Maghrib padhaatey they, phir merey ghar mein dakhil hotey aur do rakaatein padhtey they. Aur logon ko Isha padhaatey they, aur merey ghar mein dakhil hotey aur do rakaatein padhtey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1116","Umm Habeeba (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Zuhr se pehley chaar rakaaton aur uskey baad chaar ki muhaafazat karey to Allah usey dozakh par haraam kar dega. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai. Aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1117","Abdullah bin As-Saaib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suraj dhalney key baad Zuhr se pehley chaar padhtey they aur farmatey they: Beshak wo ghadi hai jis mein aasmaan key darwaazey kholey jaatey hain. Isliye main pasand karta hun ke us mein mera naik amal chadhey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1118","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Zuhr se pehley chaar na padhtey to unhey uskey baad padhtey they. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1119","Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr key dil mein chaar rakaatein padhtey they, unkey darmiyaan muqarrab farishton par aur Musalmanon aur mominon mein se jo unki pairwi kartey hain, salaam key sath judai kartey they. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1120","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us shakhs par rehem farmaye jis ne Asr se pehley chaar padhein. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1121","Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr se pehley do rakaatein padhtey they. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1122","Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maghrib se pehley padho. Teesri mein farmaya: Jo chaahey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1123","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key badey sahaaba ko dekha ke wo Maghrib key waqt sutoonon ki taraf daudtey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1124","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein suraj ghuroob honay key baad Maghrib se pehley do rakaatein padhtey they. To kaha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey padha tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap hamein unhey padhtey huey dekhtey they lekin hamein na hukm detey they aur na mana farmatey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1125","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Madina mein they. Phir jab moazzin Maghrib ki namaz key liye azaan deta to sutoonon ki taraf daudtey aur do rakaatein padhtey. Yahan tak ke ajnabi aadmi masjid mein dakhil hota to gumaan karta ke namaz padhi jaa chuki hai unki kasrat ki wjah se jo unhey padhtey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1126","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Juma padhey to uskey baad chaar padhey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1127","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Juma key baad namaz nahi padhtey they yahan tak ke wapas aatey. To apne ghar mein do rakaatein padhtey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1128","Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz padho ae logon apne gharon mein. Kyonke aadmi ki namaz uskey ghar mein hai siwaey farz key. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1129","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni namaz mein se apne gharon mein rakho, aur unhey qabrein na banao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1130","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni namaz apni masjid mein poori karey to apne ghar key liye apni namaz mein se hissa rakhey. Kyonke Allah uskey ghar mein uski namaz key sabab bhalai rakheyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1131","Umar bin Ata se riwayat hai ke Naafe bin Jubair ne usey Saaib jo Namr key bhanjey hain, key paas bheja taake un se uskey baarey mein poochhey jo Muawiya ne namaz mein un se dekha tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Haan, main ne unkey sath Maqsoora mein Juma padha. Phir jab imam ne salaam phera to main apni jagah khada hua aur namaz padhi. Phir jab wo dakhil huey to merey paas bheja aur farmaya: Jo tum ne kya usey na dohrao: Jab tum Juma padho to usey namaz key sath na milao yahan tak ke baat karo ya niklo. Kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein iska hukm diya hai ke ham namaz ko namaz key sath na milaein yahan tak ke ham baat karein ya niklein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1132","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Witr farz namaz ki tarah lazmi nahi hai, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand farmata hai. Isliye witr padho ae Quran walon. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai. Aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1133","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne raat key har hissey mein witr padha hai: Raat key awwal se, aur uskey darmiyaan se, aur uskey aakhir se. Aur Aap ka witr sehri tak khatm hua. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1134","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Apni raat ki aakhri namaz witr banao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1135","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Subah honay se pehley witr padho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1136","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein namaz padhtey they jabke wo Aap key saamney aadi leti huein thein. Phir jab witr baqi rehta to unhey jagaatey aur wo witr padhtin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Phir jab witr baqi rehta to farmatey: Utho aur witr padho ae Aaisha."
"1137","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Subah ko witr key sath jaldi karo. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai. Aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1138","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo darta ho ke wo raat mein nahi uthega to awwal mein witr padhey. Aur jo ummeed rakhta ho ke wo aakhir mein uthega to raat key aakhir mein witr padhey. Kyonke raat key aakhir ki namaz haazir hoti hai, aur wo afzal hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1139","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey har maah teen din rozey rakhne ki, aur Chaasht ki do rakaaton ki, aur soney se pehley witr padhney ki waseeyat ki. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur soney se pehley witr padhna sirf uskey liye mustahab hai jo raat key aakhir mein bedaar honay ka bharosa na rakhta ho. Phir agar bharosa rakhta ho to raat ka aakhir afzal hai."
"1140","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik key har jor par subah sadqa hai: To har tasbeeh sadqa hai, aur har tehleel sadqa hai, aur har takbeer sadqa hai. Aur bhalai ka hukm sadqa hai, aur burai se rokna sadqa hai. Aur iski taraf se do rakaatein kaafi hain jo Chaasht mein padhta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1141","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Chaasht chaar padhtey they aur jitna Allah chaahta zyada kartey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1142","Umm Haani Faakhta bint Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Fatah key saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas gai aur Aap ko ghusl farmatey huey paaya. Phir jab Aap apne ghusl se faarigh huey to aath rakaatein padhein, aur wo Chaasht thi. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ki aik riwayat key mukhtasar lafz hain)."
"1143","Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne qaum ko Chaasht mein namaz padhtey huey dekha. To farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak wo jaantey hain ke is ghadi key siwa namaz afzal hai. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tauba karne walon ki namaz jab oont key bachchey garmi mehsoos karein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1144","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to na baith-ney yahan tak ke do rakaatein padhey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1145","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap masjid mein they. To farmaya: Do rakaatein padho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1146","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bilaal se farmaya: Ae Bilaal! Mujhey us ummeed waley amal ki khabar do jo tum ne Islam mein kya hai. Kyonke main ne Jannat mein apne saamney tumharey jooton ki aahat suni hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne nazdeek is se zyada ummeed wala amal nahi kya ke main ne raat ya din ki kisi ghadi mein poora wuzu nahi kya magar us wuzu key sath itni namaz padhi jitni merey liye likhi gai thi ke main padhun. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai)."
"1147","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtreen din jis par suraj tuloo hota hai Juma ka din hai: Us mein Aadam paida kiye gaey, aur us mein Jannat mein dakhil kiye gaey, aur us mein us se nikaaley gaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1148","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo wuzu karey aur achchha wuzu karey, phir Juma mein aey aur suney aur khamosh rahey to uskey aur Juma key darmiyaan bakhsh diya jaata hai aur teen din zyada. Aur jo kankari chhooyey to us ne laghv kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1149","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paanch namazein aur Juma sey Juma tak, aur Ramazan sey Ramazan tak, darmiyaan ka kaffara hain jab kabeera gunaahon se bacha jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1150","Unhin se aur Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke un donon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne mimbar ki lakdiyon par farmatey huey suna: Qaumein Juma chhorney se zaroor baaz aaengi, warna Allah unkey dilon par mohar laga dega, phir wo ghaafilon mein se hongey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1151","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Juma mein aey to ghusl karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1152","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Juma ka ghusl har baaligh par waajib hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1153","Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Juma key din wuzu karey to us se aur khoob hai. Aur jo ghusl karey to ghusl afzal hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1154","Salmaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aadmi Juma key din ghusl karta hai, aur jitna ho sakey paaki haasil karta hai, aur apne tail mein se tail lagata hai, ya apne ghar ki khushbu mein se lagata hai. Phir nikalta hai aur do key darmiyaan tafreeq nahi karta. Phir jitni uskey liye likhi gai hai padhta hai. Phir khamosh rehta hai jab imam kalaam karta hai, to uskey aur doosrey Juma key darmiyaan bakhsh diya jaata hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1155","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Juma key din janaabat key ghusl jaisa ghusl karey, phir pehli ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne oontni qurbaan ki. Aur jo doosri ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne gaay qurbaan ki. Aur jo teesri ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne seengon wala mendha qurbaan kya. Aur jo chauthi ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne murghi qurbaan ki. Aur jo paanchwein ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne anda qurbaan kya. Phir jab imam nikley to farishtey zikr sun-ney key liye haazir hotey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1156","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Juma key din ka zikr kya aur farmaya: Us mein ghadi hai jisey Musalman banda paa ley jabke wo khada namaz padh raha ho aur Allah se koi chiz maangey to wo usey ata farmayega. Aur apne haath se ishara kya ke usey kam karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1157","Abu Burda bin Abi Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Kya tum ne apne waalid ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Juma ki ghadi key baarey mein hadis bayan kartey huey suna hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan, main ne usey kehtey huey suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Wo imam key baith-ney aur namaz poori honay key darmiyaan hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1158","Aus bin Aus (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumharey behtreen dinon mein se Juma ka din hai. Isliye us mein mujh par kasrat se durood bhejo, kyonke tumhara durood mujh par pesh kya jaata hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1159","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Makkah se Madina ka irada karke nikley. Phir jab ham Azwara key qareeb they to utrey, phir apne donon haath uthayein aur aik ghadi Allah se dua maangi. Phir sajdey mein giR gaey aur taweel thehrey. Phir khadey huey aur apne donon haath aik ghadi uthayein, phir sajdey mein giR gaey, teen martaba aisa kya, aur farmaya: Beshak main ne apne Rab se maanga aur apni ummat key liye sifarish ki. To us ne mujhey meri ummat ka tihaai diya. To main apne Rab key liye shukr ka sajda kya. Phir apna sar uthaya aur apne Rab se apni ummat key liye maanga. To us ne mujhey meri ummat ka tihaai diya. To main apne Rab key liye shukr ka sajda kya. Phir apna sar uthaya aur apne Rab se apni ummat key liye maanga. To us ne mujhey aakhri tihaai diya. To main apne Rab key liye sajdey mein giR gaya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1160","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein qayaam farmatey they yahan tak ke Aap key donon qadam phat jaatey they. To main ne Aap se kaha: Tum ye kyun kartey ho ya Rasulullah, jabke tumharey liye tumhara agla aur peechla gunaah bakhsh diya gaya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya main shukr guzaar banda na banun? (Muttafaqun aleh, aur Mugheera bin Shoba se isi tarah riwayat hai, Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1161","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein unkey aur Faatima key paas aey aur farmaya: Kya tum donon namaz nahi padhtey? (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1162","Saalim bin Abdullah bin Umar bin Al-Khattab (Raziallahu anhum) se apne waalid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Abdullah kitna achchha aadmi hai, kaash wo raat mein namaz padhta! Saalim ne kaha: To Abdullah uskey baad thoda hi sotey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1163","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Fulaan ki tarah na hona: Wo raat mein qayaam karta tha phir us ne raat ka qayaam chhor diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1164","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aik aadmi ka zikr kya gaya jo raat bhar sota raha yahan tak ke subah ho gai! Aap ne farmaya: Wo aadmi hai jiskey donon kaanon mein, ya farmaya: Kaan mein, shaitaan ne peshaab kar diya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1165","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaitaan tum mein se har aik key sar ki guddi par girah lagaata hai jab wo sota hai, teen girah. Har girah par maarta hai: Tum par lambi raat hai, isliye so jao. Phir agar tum mein se koi bedaar ho aur Allah Taala ka zikr karey to girah khul jaati hai. Phir agar wuzu karey to girah khul jaati hai. Phir agar namaz padhey to girah khul jaati hai. To wo subah chust aur achchhey nafs key sath karta hai, warna subah burey nafs aur susti key sath karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1166","Abdullah bin Salaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logon! Salaam pheelayo, aur khaana khilayo, aur raat mein namaz padho jab log so rahey hon. Jannat mein salaamti key sath dakhil hojaogey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1167","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan key baad afzal rozey Allah key maheeney Muharram key hain, aur farz key baad afzal namaz raat ki namaz hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1168","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do hai. Phir jab subah ka khauf ho to aik key sath witr karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1169","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein do do padhtey they, aur aik key sath witr kartey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1170","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maheeney mein iftaar farmatey they yahan tak ke ham gumaan kartey ke Aap us mein roza nahi rakheingey. Aur rozey rakhtey they yahan tak ke ham gumaan kartey ke Aap us mein se kuchh iftaar nahi kareingey. Aur tum Aap ko raat mein namaz padhtey huey dekhna chaho to dekhtey, aur sotey huey dekhna chaho to dekhtey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1171","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gyaarah rakaatein padhtey they, yaani raat mein. Us mein se sajda itna lamba kartey jitna tum mein se koi pachaas aayaat padhey is se pehley ke apna sar uthaye. Aur Fajr ki namaz se pehley do rakaatein padhtey, phir daayein pehlu par late jaatey yahan tak ke moazzin namaz key liye aata. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1172","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan aur ghair mein gyaarah rakaaton se zyada nahi padhtey they: Chaar padhtey, to unkey husn aur tool key baarey mein na poochho! Phir chaar padhtey, to unkey husn aur tool key baarey mein na poochho! Phir teen padhtey. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum witr se pehley sotey ho!? To farmaya: Ae Aaisha! Beshak meri aankhein soti hain aur mera dil nahi sota. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1173","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat key awwal mein sotey they, aur uskey aakhir mein uthkar namaz padhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1174","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat mein namaz padhi. To Aap khadey rahey yahan tak ke main ne burey kaam ka irada kya. Kaha gaya: Tum ne kya irada kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne irada kya ke baith jaun aur Aap ko chhor dun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1175","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath aik raat namaz padhi. To Aap ne Baqarah se shuru kya. To main ne kaha: Aap sau par ruku kareingey. Phir aagey badhey. To main ne kaha: Aap usey aik rakaat mein padheingey. To aagey badhey. To main ne kaha: Aap us se ruku kareingey. Phir Nisa shuru ki aur usey padha. Phir Aal-e-Imran shuru ki aur usey padha. Theher theher kar padhtey they. Jab tasbeeh wali aayat par guzartey to tasbeeh kartey, aur jab sawal wali par to sawal kartey, aur jab panah wali par guzartey to panah maangtey. Phir ruku kya aur kehney lagey: Subhana Rabbi Al-Azeem. To Aap ka ruku Aap key qayaam jaisa tha. Phir kaha: Sami Allahu liman hamidah, Rabbana lakal hamd. Phir taweel khadey rahey jo ruku jaisa tha. Phir sajda kya aur kaha: Subhana Rabbi Al-Aala. To Aap ka sajda Aap key qayaam key qareeb tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1176","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya: Kaun si namaz afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Lambe qayaam wali. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1177","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ko sab se mehboob namaz Dawood ki namaz hai, aur Allah ko sab se mehboob rozey Dawood key rozey hain. Wo aadhi raat sotey they aur uska tihaai qayaam kartey they aur uska chhata hissa sotey they. Aur aik din rozey rakhtey they aur aik din iftaar kartey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1178","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak raat mein ghadi hai jisey Musalman aadmi paa ley aur Allah Taala se duniya aur aakhirat key muamley mein bhalai maangey to wo usey ata farmayega. Aur wo har raat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1179","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat mein khada ho to namaz ko do halki rakaaton se shuru karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1180","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein khadey hotey to apni namaz ko do halki rakaaton se shuru kartey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1181","Unhin se (Raziallahu anha) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ki namaz dard ya ghair ki wjah se faut ho jaati to din mein baarah rakaatein padhtey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1182","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne hizb se, ya us mein se kuchh se so jaey aur usey Fajr ki namaz aur Zuhr ki namaz key darmiyaan padhey to uskey liye likha jaeyga goya us ne usey raat mein padha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1183","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us aadmi par rehem farmaye jo raat mein khada hua aur namaz padhi aur apni biwi ko jagaaya. Phir agar wo inkaar karey to uskey chehrey mein paani chhidka. Aur Allah us aurat par rehem farmaye jo raat mein khadi hui aur namaz padhi aur apne shohar ko jagaaya. Phir agar wo inkaar karey to uskey chehrey mein paani chhidka. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1184","Unhin se aur Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi raat mein apne ghar walon ko jagaey aur wo donon namaz padhein ya donon mil kar do rakaatein padhein to zaakir mardon aur zaakir aurton mein likhey jaatey hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1185","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein oonghey to so jaey yahan tak ke us se neend door ho jaey. Kyonke tum mein se jab koi namaz padhta hai jabke wo oongh raha hai to shayed wo maghfirat maangney jaey aur apne aap ko bura kahey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1186","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi raat mein khada ho aur uski zabaan par Quran mushkil ho jaey aur wo na jaaney ke wo kya kehta hai to late jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1187","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan mein imaan aur sawaab ki ummeed key sath qayaam karey to uskey guzashta gunaah bakhsh diye jaatey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1188","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan mein qayaam ki targheeb detey they baghair iskey ke un mein azm key sath hukm dein. To farmatey: Jo Ramazan mein imaan aur sawaab ki ummeed key sath qayaam karey to uskey guzashta gunaah bakhsh diye jaatey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1189","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Lailatul Qadr mein imaan aur sawaab ki ummeed key sath qayaam karey to uskey guzashta gunaah bakhsh diye jaatey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1190","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se kuchh aadmiyon ko Lailatul Qadr khuwab mein aakhri saat mein dikhai gai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main dekhta hun ke tumharey khuwab aakhri saat mein mutaabiq huey hain. Phir jo usey talaash karne wala ho to usey aakhri saat mein talaash karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1191","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan key aakhri ashrey mein etikaf farmatey they aur farmatey they: Lailatul Qadr ko Ramazan key aakhri ashrey mein talaash karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1192","Unhin se (Raziallahu anha) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lailatul Qadr ko Ramazan key aakhri ashrey ki taaq mein talaash karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1193","Unhin se (Raziallahu anha) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Ramazan ka aakhri ashra dakhil hota to raat ko zinda kartey, aur apne ghar walon ko jagaatey, aur koshish kartey aur kamar kastey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1194","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan mein koshish farmatey they jo ghair mein nahi farmatey they, aur uskey aakhri ashrey mein jo ghair mein nahi farmatey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1195","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bataein agar main jaan lun ke Lailatul Qadr kaun si hai to us mein kya kahun? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak Tu darguzar karne wala hai aur darguzar ko pasand farmata hai, isliye mujhey darguzar farma. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1196","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar meri ummat par, ya logon par mushkil na hoti to main unhey har namaz key sath miswaak ka hukm deta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1197","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab neend se uth-tey to miswaak se apna munh saaf kartey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1198","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah key liye Aap ki miswaak aur Aap ka wuzu taiyaar kartey they. To Allah Aap ko raat mein se jitna chaahta uthata tha. To Aap miswaak kartey aur wuzu kartey aur namaz padhtey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1199","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tum par miswaak mein bahut kaha hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1200","Shuraih bin Haani se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se poochha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne ghar mein dakhil hotey to kis chiz se shuru farmatey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Miswaak se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1201","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dakhil hua jabke miswaak ka kinara Aap ki zabaan par tha. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai."
"1202","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miswaak munh ki paaki hai aur Rab ki raza hai. Ise Nasaai aur Ibn Khuzaima ne apni Sahih mein sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai."
"1203","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitrat paanch hain, ya fitrat mein se paanch: Khatna, aur naaf key neechey baal saaf karna, aur naakhun kaatna, aur baghal key baal ukhaadna, aur moonchh kaatna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1204","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitrat mein se das hain: Moonchh kaatna, aur daadhi badhana, aur miswaak, aur paani se naak saaf karna, aur naakhun kaatna, aur joron ko dhona, aur baghal key baal ukhaadna, aur naaf key neechey baal moonDna, aur paani se istinja karna. Rawi ne kaha: Aur main daswein ko bhool gaya, siwaey iskey ke wo kulli karna ho. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Wakee, jo uskey aik rawi hain, ne kaha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1205","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Moonchhein katrao aur daadhiyan badhao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1206","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam ki bunyaad paanch par rakhi gai hai: Gawahi ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. Namaz qaim karna, aur zakaat dena, aur Baitullah ka Hajj karna, aur Ramazan key rozey rakhna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1207","Talha bin Ubaidullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Najd key rehne walon mein se aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke uska sar bikhra hua tha, ham uski awaz ki goonj suntey they lekin samajhtey nahi they ke wo kya kehta hai, yahan tak ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key qareeb hua aur wo Islam key baarey mein poochh raha tha. To Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Din raat mein paanch namazein. Us ne kaha: Kya mujh par uskey siwa kuchh hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, siwaey iskey ke tum nafl padho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur Ramazan key maheeney key rozey. Us ne kaha: Kya mujh par uskey siwa kuchh hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, siwaey iskey ke tum nafl rakho. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey zakaat ka zikr kya. To us ne kaha: Kya mujh par uskey siwa kuchh hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, siwaey iskey ke tum nafl do. To wo aadmi peeth pher kar gaya jabke wo keh raha tha: Allah ki qasam! Main is par na zyada karunga aur na kami karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo kamyaab hua agar sachcha hua. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1208","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ki taraf bheja aur farmaya: Unhey dawat do ke gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main Allah ka Rasool hun. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah Taala ne un par har din raat mein paanch namazein farz ki hain. Phir agar wo iskey liye itaat karein to unhey khabar do ke Allah ne un par sadqa farz kya hai jo unkey maaldaaron se liya jaata hai aur unkey faqiron ko wapas kya jaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1209","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur namaz qaim karein aur zakaat dein. Phir agar wo ye karein to unhon-ne mujh se apne khoon aur maal bacha liye siwaey Islam key haq key, aur unka hisaab Allah par hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1210","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah faut ho gaey aur Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) they, aur Arab mein se jis ne kufr kya kufr kya. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Logon se kaisey qitaal kya jaeyga jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo kahein La ilaha illallah. Phir jo usey kahey to us ne mujh se apna maal aur jaan bacha li siwaey uskey haq key, aur uska hisaab Allah par hai?! To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor us se qitaal karunga jo namaz aur zakaat key darmiyaan farq karey. Kyonke zakaat maal ka haq hai. Allah ki qasam! Agar wo mujhey rassi roktey jo wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko detey they to main usey rokne par un se qitaal karta. Unhon-ne kaha: Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Wo sirf ye tha ke main ne dekha ke Allah ne Abu Bakr ka seena qitaal key liye khol diya hai. To main ne pehchaan liya ke wo haq hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1211","Abu Ayyub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhey aise amal ki khabar dein jo mujhey Jannat mein dakhil karey. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur namaz qaim karo, aur zakaat do, aur rishta joro. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1212","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke dehaati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aise amal ki rahnumai karein jo main karun to Jannat mein dakhil hun. Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur namaz qaim karo, aur farz zakaat do, aur Ramazan key rozey rakho. Us ne kaha: Us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Main is par zyada nahi karunga. Phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chahta hai ke Jannat walon mein se aadmi ko dekhey to isey dekhey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1213","Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se namaz qaim karne par, aur zakaat dene par, aur har Musalman ki khairkhwahi par baiyat ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1214","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo soney ya chaandi wala ho aur us mein se uska haq na deta ho to qayamat key din uskey liye aag ki silon key sath bichhaaya jaeyga. To us par dozakh ki aag mein garm kya jaeyga aur us se uska pehlu aur peshaani aur peeth daaghi jaeygi. Jab thandi hogi to uskey liye wapas ki jaeygi us din mein jiski miqdaar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon key darmiyaan faisla kya jaeyga aur wo apna raasta dekheyga, ya Jannat ki taraf ya dozakh ki taraf. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! To oont? Aap ne farmaya: Aur oont wala jo us mein se uska haq na deta ho, aur uskey haq mein se hai uska doodh pilana jis din wo ghaat par aey, to qayamat key din uskey liye kushada chatyal maidaan mein bithaya jaeyga jabke wo sab se zyada hongey, us mein se aik bachcha bhi kam nahi hoga. Wo usey apne khuron se raundeingey aur apne munhon se kaateingey. Jab unki pehli us par guzregi to unki aakhri us par wapas aayegi, us din mein jiski miqdaar pachaas hazaar saal hai, yahan tak ke bandon key darmiyaan faisla kya jaeyga aur wo apna raasta dekheyga, ya Jannat ki taraf ya dozakh ki taraf. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! To gaay aur bakri? Aap ne farmaya: Aur gaay aur bakri wala jo us mein se uska haq na deta ho to qayamat key din uskey liye chatyal maidaan mein bithaya jaeyga, us mein se kuchh kam nahi hoga, us mein na tedhey seengon wali hai, aur na baghair seengon wali, aur na tooti hui seengon wali. Wo usey apne seengon se maareingi aur apne khuron se raundeingi. Jab unki pehli us par guzregi to unki aakhri us par wapas aayegi, us din mein jiski miqdaar pachaas hazaar saal hai yahan tak ke bandon key darmiyaan faisla kya jaeyga aur wo apna raasta dekheyga, ya Jannat ki taraf ya dozakh ki taraf. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! To ghodey? Aap ne farmaya: Ghodey teen hain: Wo kisi key liye bojh hain, aur wo kisi key liye parda hain, aur wo kisi key liye ajr hain. Raha jo uskey liye bojh hain to wo aadmi hai jo usey riya aur fakhr key liye aur Musalmanon ki dushmani key liye baandhta hai. To wo uskey liye bojh hain. Aur raha jo uskey liye parda hain to wo aadmi hai jo usey Allah key raastey mein baandhta hai, phir uski peeth aur gardan mein jo hai usey nahi bhoolta. To wo uskey liye parda hain. Aur raha jo uskey liye ajr hain to wo aadmi hai jo usey Allah key raastey mein Musalmanon key liye charagaah ya baagh mein baandhta hai. To wo uskey pait mein jo khaeyga us charagaah ya baagh mein se to uskey liye nekiyan hongi. Aur uskey leed aur peshaab key barabar uskey liye nekiyan hongi. Aur wo uski rassi nahi todega aur aik ya do teelon par chadhega magar Allah uskey liye uskey qadam key nishaan aur uskey leed key barabar nekiyan likhega. Aur wo usey neher par se na guzaarega aur wo us mein se piyega jabke wo usey pilana nahi chaahta tha magar Allah uskey liye uskey piye huey key barabar nekiyan likhega. Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! To gadhey? Aap ne farmaya: Mujh par gadhey key baarey mein ye jaame tanha aayat key siwa kuchh naazil nahi hua: Phir jo zarra barabar bhalai karega usey dekheyga, aur jo zarra barabar burai karega usey dekheyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1215","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Aadmi key betey ka har amal uskey liye hai siwaey rozey key. Kyonke wo merey liye hai aur main uska badla dunga. Aur roza dhaal hai. Phir jab tum mein se kisi ka rozey ka din ho to behayai ki baat na karey aur na shor karey. Phir agar koi usey bura kahey ya us se qitaal karey to kahey: Beshak main rozedaar hun. Aur us zaat ki qasam jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Rozedaar key munh ki boo Allah key nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada achchhi hai. Rozedaar key liye do khushiyan hain jin se wo khush hota hai: Jab iftaar karta hai to apne iftaar se khush hota hai, aur jab apne Rab se milega to apne rozey se khush hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Bukhari ki riwayat ka lafz hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Wo apna khaana aur peena aur khuwahish meri raah mein chhorta hai. Roza merey liye hai aur main uska badla dunga, aur neki das guna hai. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Aadmi key betey ka har amal badhaya jaata hai: Neki das guna sey saat sau guna tak. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Siwaey rozey key kyonke wo merey liye hai aur main uska badla dunga: Wo apni khuwahish aur khaana meri raah mein chhorta hai. Rozedaar key liye do khushiyan hain: Apne iftaar key waqt khushi, aur apne Rab se milney key waqt khushi. Aur uskey munh ki boo Allah key nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se zyada achchhi hai."
"1216","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key raastey mein joda kharch karey to Jannat key darwaazon se pukaara jaeyga: Ae Allah key bandey! Ye bhalai hai. Phir jo namaz walon mein se hoga to namaz key darwaazey se bulaaya jaeyga. Aur jo jihad walon mein se hoga to jihad key darwaazey se bulaaya jaeyga. Aur jo rozey walon mein se hoga to Rayyaan key darwaazey se bulaaya jaeyga. Aur jo sadqa walon mein se hoga to sadqa key darwaazey se bulaaya jaeyga. Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Merey maa baap tum par qurbaan ya Rasulullah! Us par koi zaroorat nahi jo un darwaazon mein se bulaaya jaey. To kya koi un tamaam darwaazon se bulaaya jaeyga? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, aur mujhey ummeed hai ke tum un mein se hogey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1217","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein darwaza hai jisey Rayyaan kaha jaata hai. Us mein se rozedaar qayamat key din dakhil hongey, us mein se unkey siwa koi dakhil nahi hoga. Kaha jaeyga: Rozedaar kahaan hain? To wo khadey hongey, us mein se unkey siwa koi dakhil nahi hoga. Phir jab wo dakhil hongey to band kar diya jaeyga aur us mein se koi dakhil nahi hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1218","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo banda Allah key raastey mein aik din roza rakhey to Allah us din key sabab uskey chehrey ko dozakh se sattar saal door kar dega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1219","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan mein imaan aur sawaab ki ummeed key sath rozey rakhey to uskey guzashta gunaah bakhsh diye jaatey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1220","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Ramazan aata hai to Jannat key darwaazey khol diye jaatey hain, aur dozakh key darwaazey band kar diye jaatey hain, aur shayaateen jakad diye jaatey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1221","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaand dekh kar rozey rakho, aur chaand dekh kar iftaar karo. Phir agar tum par chhup jaey to Shaabaan ki ginti tees poori karo. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai). Aur Muslim ki riwayat mein hai: Phir agar tum par ghata chha jaey to tees din rozey rakho."
"1222","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein sab se sakhi they, aur Ramazan mein sab se zyada sakhi hotey they jab Jibraeel Aap se miltey they. Aur Jibraeel Ramazan ki har raat mein Aap se miltey they aur Aap se Quran ka daur kartey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Jibraeel Aap se miltey they bheji hui hawa se zyada bhalai mein sakhi hotey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1223","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab aakhri ashra dakhil hota to raat ko zinda kartey aur apne ghar walon ko jagaatey, aur kamar kastey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1224","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi Ramazan se aik ya do din pehley rozey key sath aagey na badhey, siwaey iskey ke wo aadmi ho jo apna roza rakhta tha. To wo us din roza rakhey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1225","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan se pehley rozey na rakho. Chaand dekh kar rozey rakho aur chaand dekh kar iftaar karo. Phir agar uskey saamney haail ho jaey to tees din poorey karo. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1226","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Shaabaan mein se nisf baqi reh jaey to rozey na rakho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1227","Abul Yaqzaan Ammaar bin Yaasir (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jo shak key din roza rakhey to us ne Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki nafarmaani ki. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1228","Talha bin Ubaidullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab chaand dekhtey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Usey ham par aman aur imaan aur salaamti aur Islam key sath tuloo farma. Mera aur tumhara Rab Allah hai. Hidayat aur bhalai ka chaand. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1229","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sehri karo kyonke sehri mein barkat hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1230","Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath sehri ki, phir ham namaz key liye khadey huey. Kaha gaya: Un donon key darmiyaan kitna tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Pachaas aayaat. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1231","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key do moazzin they: Bilaal aur Ibn Umm Maktoom. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bilaal raat mein azaan deta hai. Isliye khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom azaan dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur un donon key darmiyaan sirf itna tha ke ye utarta tha aur ye chadhta tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1232","Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: Hamarey rozey aur Ahle Kitaab key rozey key darmiyaan farq sehri khaana hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1233","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log bhalai mein raheingey jab tak iftaar mein jaldi kareingey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1234","Abu Atiya se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Masrooq Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) key paas dakhil huey. To Masrooq ne un se kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se do aadmi hain, donon bhalai mein kami nahi kartey: Un mein se aik Maghrib aur iftaar mein jaldi karta hai, aur doosra Maghrib aur iftaar mein dair karta hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Maghrib aur iftaar mein kaun jaldi karta hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah, yaani Ibn Masood. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isi tarah kartey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1235","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Merey bandon mein mujhey sab se mehboob wo hain jo iftaar mein sab se jaldi kartey hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1236","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat yahaan se aey aur din yahaan se jaey, aur suraj ghuroob ho jaey to rozedaar ne iftaar kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1237","Abu Ibrahim Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chaley jabke Aap rozedaar they. Phir jab suraj ghuroob ho gaya to Aap ne qaum mein se baaz se farmaya: Ae fulaan! Utro aur hamarey liye sattu ghoolo. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash shaam ho jaey? Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur hamarey liye sattu ghoolo. Us ne kaha: Beshak tum par din hai. Aap ne farmaya: Utro aur hamarey liye sattu ghoolo. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo utra aur unkey liye sattu ghoola. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne piya, phir farmaya: Jab tum raat ko dekho ke wo yahaan se aa gai hai to rozedaar ne iftaar kya. Aur apne haath se mashriq ki taraf ishara kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1238","Salmaan bin Aamir Zabbi Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi iftaar karey to khajoor se iftaar karey. Phir agar na paey to paani se iftaar karey kyonke wo paak hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1239","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz se pehley taaza khajooron se iftaar farmatey they. Phir agar taaza khajoorein na hotin to chhoti khajooron se. Phir agar chhoti khajoorein na hotin to paani key chand ghoont peetey they. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1240","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ka rozey ka din ho to behayai ki baat na karey aur na shor karey. Phir agar koi usey bura kahey ya us se qitaal karey to kahey: Beshak main rozedaar hun."
"1241","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo jhooti baat kehna aur us par amal karna na chhorey to Allah ko haajat nahi ke wo apna khaana aur peena chhorey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1242","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi bhool jaey aur kha ley ya pi ley to apna roza poora karey. Kyonke usey Allah ne khilaaya aur pilaaya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1243","Laqeet bin Sabira (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey wuzu key baarey mein khabar dein? Aap ne farmaya: Wuzu poora karo, aur ungliyon key darmiyaan khilaal karo, aur naak mein paani chadhaaney mein mubaalgha karo, siwaey iskey ke tum rozedaar ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1244","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Fajr paati thi jabke Aap apne ghar walon ki taraf se junbi hotey they, phir ghusl farmatey they aur rozey rakhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1245","Aaisha aur Umm Salama (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ehtelaam key baghair junbi subah farmatey they, phir rozey rakhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1246","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ramazan key baad afzal rozey Allah key maheeney Muharram key hain, aur farz key baad afzal namaz raat ki namaz hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1247","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maheeney mein Shaabaan se zyada rozey nahi rakhtey they. Kyonke Aap Shaabaan poora rozey rakhtey they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aap Shaabaan mein thodey key siwa rozey rakhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1248","Mujeeba Baahiliya se apne waalid ya chacha se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey, phir gaey aur saal baad Aap key paas aey jabke unki haalat aur shakal badal gai thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum mujhey nahi pehchaantey? Aap ne farmaya: Aur tum kaun ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Main Baahili hun jo pichhley saal tumharey paas aaya tha. Aap ne farmaya: To tumhey kis ne badal diya, jabke tum achchhi shakal waley they? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne tum se judaa honay key baad raat key siwa khaana nahi khaaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne apne aap ko azaab diya! Phir farmaya: Sabr key maheeney ka roza rakho, aur har maah mein aik din ka. Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey zyada dein, kyonke mujh mein taqat hai. Aap ne farmaya: Do din ka roza rakho. Unhon-ne kaha: Zyada dein. Aap ne farmaya: Teen din ka roza rakho. Unhon-ne kaha: Zyada dein. Aap ne farmaya: Hurmat walon mein se roza rakho aur chhoro, hurmat walon mein se roza rakho aur chhoro, hurmat walon mein se roza rakho aur chhoro. Aur apni teen ungliyon key sath farmaya aur unhey jama kya, phir chhora. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1249","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi din nahi jin mein naik amal Allah ko in dinon se zyada mehboob ho, yaani ashrey key din. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur Allah key raastey mein jihad bhi nahi? Aap ne farmaya: Aur Allah key raastey mein jihad bhi nahi, siwaey us aadmi key jo apni jaan aur maal key sath nikla aur us mein se kuchh ley kar wapas na aaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1250","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Arafa key din key rozey key baarey mein poochha gaya? Aap ne farmaya: Wo pichhley saal aur baqi saal ka kaffara hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1251","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aashoora key din roza rakha aur uskey rozey ka hukm diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1252","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Aashoora key din key rozey key baarey mein poochha gaya. To farmaya: Wo pichhley saal ka kaffara hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1253","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar main aainda saal tak raha to nawein ka roza rakhunga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1254","Abu Ayyub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan key rozey rakhey phir uskey baad Shawwal mein se chhey rakhey to wo hamesha key rozey ki tarah tha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1255","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Peer key din key rozey key baarey mein poochha gaya. To farmaya: Wo din hai jis mein main paida hua, aur din hai jis mein mujhey mab'oos kya gaya ya mujh par naazil hua. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1256","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aamaal Peer aur Jumeraat key din pesh kiye jaatey hain. Isliye main pasand karta hun ke mera amal pesh kya jaey jabke main rozedaar hun. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur Muslim ne rozey key zikr key baghair riwayat kya hai."
"1257","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Peer aur Jumeraat ka roza rakhne ka ehtimaam farmatey they. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1258","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey teen ki waseeyat ki: Har maah mein teen din rozey rakhna, aur Chaasht ki do rakaatein, aur soney se pehley witr padhna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1259","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey mehboob (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey teen ki waseeyat ki jinhey main jab tak zinda hun nahi chhorunga: Har maah mein teen din rozey rakhna, aur Chaasht ki namaz, aur soney se pehley witr padhey baghair na sona. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1260","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Har maah mein teen din ka roza poorey zamaaney key rozey ki tarah hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1261","Muaza Adawiya se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se poochha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har maah mein teen din rozey rakhtey they? To unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To main ne kaha: Maheeney mein se kis din rozey rakhtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo parwah nahi farmatey they ke maheeney mein se kis din rozey rakhtey hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1262","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum maheeney mein teen rozey rakho to teerah, aur chaudah aur pandrah ko rakho. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1263","Qatada bin Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein ayyaam-e-beez key rozey rakhne ka hukm detey they: Teerah, aur chaudah aur pandrah. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1264","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hazar aur safar mein ayyaam-e-beez mein iftaar nahi farmatey they. Ise Nasaai ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1265","Zaid bin Khaalid Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo rozedaar ko iftaar karaey to uskey liye uskey ajr jaisa hoga, lekin rozedaar key ajr mein kuchh kami nahi hogi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1266","Umm Umaara Ansaariya (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas dakhil huey aur unhon-ne Aap key saamney khaana pesh kya. To farmaya: Khao. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main rozedaar hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak rozedaar par farishtey rehmat bhejtey hain jab uskey paas khaaya jaata hai yahan tak ke wo faarigh hon, aur shayed farmaya: Yahan tak ke wo sair hon. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1267","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Saad bin Ubaada (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aey. To wo roti aur tail laey. To khaaya, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumharey paas rozedaaron ne iftaar kya, aur tumhara khaana nekon ne khaaya, aur tum par farishton ne rehmat bheji. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
